// Limit 2, as a CONTRACT: masking is ALL interrupts, not per level.
//
// There is deliberately no syntax here for "mask only level 3" — the seam takes
// no level and the construct offers no place to put one. Correct but blunt;
// priority-level masking is deferred WITH its consumer (audio). The fixture pins
// that a region protecting something that only races one level still compiles,
// and still costs the whole mask, with no way to say otherwise.
fn copper_wait() {
    seal {
        rune copjmp1: u16 at 0xDFF088 write;
        copjmp1.strobe();
    }
}
fn main() { copper_wait(); }
